- JSX
JSX is not HTML in Javascript. It is HTML/XML like syntax.

- Babel transpiles JSX into browser understandable code
Babel --> transpilation --> React.createElement --> ReactElement (Object) --> HTMLElement (render)

- Extensions
1. Prettier
2. Bracket Pair Colorizer
3. ES lint
4. Better Comments

- React Component
- Class based components - OLD way - uses JS classes to write components
- Functional Components - NEW - uses JS functions to write components
- Functional components are JS functions that return a JSX Element.

- Component Composition: component present inside a component 
- JSX also sanitizes the code before rendering
- any JS can be written in {} in JSX